<body>

    <!-- ===== NAVBAR (shared partial) ===== -->
    <%- include('partials/dash-navbar', { activeTab: 'tabAbout' }) %>



        <!-- ===== PAGE ===== -->

        <div class="about-page page-transition">



            <!-- Hero -->

            <header class="about-hero">

                <div class="about-hero__content">

                    <h1 class="about-hero__title">Pioneering Smart Campus Navigation</h1>

                    <p class="about-hero__sub">Empowering students, faculty, and visitors at Camarines Sur Polytechnic

                        Colleges through innovative spatial technology and sustainable design.</p>

                </div>

            </header>



            <!-- Main Content -->

            <main class="about-container">



                <!-- CSPC History & Description -->

                <section class="split-block">

                    <div class="split-content">

                        <span class="section-tag">Our Institution</span>

                        <h2 class="section-title">Camarines Sur Polytechnic Colleges</h2>

                        <p>CSPC is a premier polytechnic institution in the Bicol Region, committed to providing quality

                            education in engineering, technology, business, and health sciences. Founded on the
                            principles

                            of excellence and innovation, the college continuously strives to produce highly competent

                            professionals.</p>

                        <p>As the campus expands to accommodate growing academic programs and an increasing student
                            body,

                            the need for efficient campus management and navigation has become more vital than ever.

                            CampuSphere acts as a digital twin to this dynamic physical environment.</p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="split-media">

                        <img src="/img/campus-hero.jpg" alt="CSPC Campus Overview" loading="lazy">

                    </div>

                </section>



                <!-- Project Overview & Problem Statement -->

                <section class="split-block reverse">

                    <div class="split-content">

                        <span class="section-tag">The Challenge</span>

                        <h2 class="section-title">Why CampuSphere?</h2>

                        <p><strong>The Problem:</strong> Navigating a growing campus can be overwhelming for freshmen,

                            transferees, and visitors. Finding specific halls, offices, or tracking down event locations

                            often leads to wasted time and unnecessary confusion. Furthermore, campus administration
                            lacks a

                            centralized, digital view of facility utilization.</p>

                        <p><strong>The Solution:</strong> CampuSphere is an interactive web-based campus map and
                            directory.

                            It provides real-time geographic insights, detailed building profiles, floor plans, and a

                            centralized hub for campus events. By merging GIS data with an intuitive interface, we
                            transform

                            the physical campus into an easily accessible digital experience.</p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="split-media">

                        <img src="/img/Camarines-sur-polytechnic-colleges.png" alt="Students navigating campus"
                            loading="lazy">

                    </div>

                </section>



                <!-- SDG Alignment -->

                <section>

                    <div class="section-header">

                        <span class="section-tag">Sustainable Impact</span>

                        <h2 class="section-title">Aligning with Global Goals</h2>

                        <p class="section-desc">CampuSphere isn't just a convenience tool; it's built to support the
                            United

                            Nations Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) by fostering better education access and
                            innovative

                            infrastructure.</p>

                    </div>



                    <div class="sdg-grid">

                        <!-- SDG 4 -->

                        <div class="sdg-card sdg-4">

                            <div class="sdg-icon">

                                <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">

                                    <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z" />

                                    <path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5" />

                                </svg>

                            </div>

                            <h3 class="sdg-title">Quality Education (SDG 4)</h3>

                            <p class="sdg-desc">By making campus facilities, libraries, and event schedules easily

                                accessible, CampuSphere ensures that students can focus on learning rather than
                                logistics.

                                It creates an inclusive environment where all educational resources are geographically

                                transparent to every student.</p>

                        </div>

                        <!-- SDG 9 -->

                        <div class="sdg-card sdg-9">

                            <div class="sdg-icon">

                                <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">

                                    <path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6" />

                                </svg>

                            </div>

                            <h3 class="sdg-title">Industry, Innovation & Infrastructure (SDG 9)</h3>

                            <p class="sdg-desc">CampuSphere modernizes institutional infrastructure by taking physical

                                campus maps into the digital age. It represents a technological innovation in facility

                                management, promoting a sustainable and highly efficient campus environment through
                                smart

                                technology.</p>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </section>



                <!-- Team Dutchess -->

